  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionOfFactorsWhichLedToRecognitionOfGainOnBargainPurchaseTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;【報告セグメントごとの負ののれん発生益に関する情報】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;前連結会計年度(自　&lt;span&gt;2021年７月１日&lt;/span&gt;　至　&lt;span&gt;2022年６月30日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度(自　&lt;span&gt;2022年７月１日&lt;/span&gt;　至　&lt;span&gt;2023年６月30日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionOfFactorsWhichLedToRecognitionOfGainOnBargainPurchaseTextBlock>
